# CR 612.2, 702.37e (the words of its morph cost are read through text-changing effects, as Putrid Raptor's ruling says of
# its own). Artificial Evolution turns the face-down Initiate's "Bird" into "Elf": turning it up then may not return Bot1's
# Aven Envoy (a Bird) and returns Bot1's Llanowar Elves instead.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Raven Guild Initiate
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Mox Sapphire
Island
Aven Envoy
Artificial Evolution
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Raven Guild Initiate.Cast(Ability: Morph)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Aven Envoy.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Artificial Evolution.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.#1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Modes(Bird)
Bot1.Modes(Elf)
? Bot1.Battlefield..FaceDown = true
Bot1.Battlefield.#1.Activate(Ability: morph cost)
! Bot1.Choose(Aven Envoy)
Bot1.Choose(Llanowar Elves)

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Aven Envoy.Power = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Raven Guild Initiate.FaceDown = (absent)
